  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  sentences:
  - Hi! How is it going?
  - I see you new in here. Let me explain what is going on
  - This is YOU, a player. You can move with WASD and jump with SPACE
  - This is an indicator which shows your Infection level. If it reach 100 precent
    you wil die and if it reach 0 prescent I will die too. So yeah, watch out
  - 'Also you can throw holy water by holding MOUSE BUTTON to stun enemies and decrice
    Infection. Here you can see how many holy water bottles you have '
